# Clipper / xBase: CA-Clipper 5.3 Reference Guide and Harbour documentation; requirements/languages/clipper.md
name     clipper harbour xbase prg foxpro
keyword  FUNCTION PROCEDURE RETURN LOCAL STATIC PRIVATE PUBLIC MEMVAR FIELD IF ELSE ELSEIF ENDIF DO
keyword  WHILE ENDDO FOR TO STEP NEXT CASE OTHERWISE ENDCASE BEGIN SEQUENCE END USE INDEX ON SEEK SKIP
keyword  REPLACE WITH APPEND BLANK CLASS METHOD DATA ENDCLASS
builtin  .T. .F. .AND. .OR. .NOT. NIL QOut Len Str Val Upper Trim Date EOF
fold-case
ident-extra    .
ident-part     .
line-comment   // &&
block-comment  /* */
string   " "
string   ' '
string   [ ]
operators  +-*/^%=<>:$!@
calls
hook     c-preprocessor
